supervisor
├── when checking ports
│   ├── it recognizes a listener
│   └── it rejects a closed port
├── when waiting
│   ├── it returns after the condition succeeds
│   └── it times out when the condition stays false
├── when stopping a child
│   ├── it terminates and reaps the process
│   └── it kills a process after the grace period
└── when starting supervision
    ├── it rejects a missing paper binary
    └── it rejects an existing supervisor
